<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Dec 18.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Dec 18.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Tilbury Jan 99.00 Jan/mar 100.00</p>
<p>Avon six Dec 98.50/98.00 Jan 98.50</p>
<p>Yorkshire Jan 98.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Southampton Jan/Mar 100.50 Feb 100.50</p>
<p>Somerset Jan/Mar 98.50</p>
<p>No milling wheat business was reported.</p>
</text>
